xt": "4天前發佈，租到概率高", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_04.png"}, {"id": 5, "name": "出行超便利", "text": "距港墘捷運站 796公尺，通勤/購物都方便", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_05.png"}, {"id": 8, "name": "超棒生活機能", "text": "周邊有百貨公司/傳統市場/公園綠地/醫療機構/學校", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_08.png"}]}, "remark": {"title": "屋主說", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 153);\"><strong>歡迎加我LINE好友!</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 153);\"><strong>歡迎來電詳談約看!</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">●<strong>&nbsp;預計可遷入日：2026-9-29(週二,&nbsp;有可能提前)&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">●&nbsp;預計可看屋日：2026-9-29(&nbsp;<strong>週二,&nbsp;有可能提前)</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 153);\"><strong>~~急著入住的網友請留意以免誤會!~~</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>●&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>月租：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>12,499元(未稅)&nbsp;/&nbsp;租1年又9個月/&nbsp;住1人;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>13,099元(未稅)&nbsp;/&nbsp;租9個月/&nbsp;住1人&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 102, 0);\"><strong>!&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br>多住人酌加租金；<br>需網路者外加$350<br>水費$150/人<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>●</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>&nbsp;特色：</strong></span